  "company-logo-style": "background-image:url(\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc597fa01a0236_Big%20Fernand%20logo.avif\")",
  "title-post-2": "Big Fernand x Innovorder",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <h3>01. The context</h3>\n          <p><strong>Definition of the need</strong></p>\n          <p><strong>Big Fernand</strong>, the fast-food hamburger chain, wanted to maximize the potential of its franchisees by recommending an effective digital solution. It's a real <strong>support project</strong>, through which the franchise has equipped its restaurants with digital tools to optimize their operational efforts and improve their performance.</p>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:1920pxpx\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\">\n            <div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f2fcfc590fbb19ff07_big-fernand-1-e1553097872978.webp\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>‍<br></p>\n          <h3>02. The interview</h3>\n          <p><strong>Watch the video</strong></p>\n          <p><strong>Maëlle Ollivier</strong>, Marketing and Communication Director at <strong>Big Fernand</strong>, illustrates in this interview the<strong> synergies</strong> that have operated in the restaurants.</p>\n          <p>Discover the interview of Maëlle Ollivier!</p>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:56.206088992974244%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xL7QJehsQ1E\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>‍<br></p>\n          <h4><strong>What were their issues?</strong></h4>\n          <p>Big Fernand wanted to <strong>equip its franchisees with a digital device</strong> that would help them as much as possible in their activity.</p>\n          <h4>Why did you choose Innovorder?</h4>\n          <p>Big Fernand saw in Innovorder the <strong>only turnkey solution</strong> <strong>that could be deployed quickly</strong>. It took only three weeks, from the first contact with the teams, for the system to be operational in the restaurants.</p>\n          <p>The company was also seduced by the <strong>quality of the Backoffice solution</strong>. Big Fernand's head office can <strong>efficiently monitor the activity of its restaurants</strong> and set up <strong>promotional operations to build</strong> customer <strong>loyalty</strong>.</p>\n          <p>Franchisees have also felt the benefits of Innovorder solutions. In particular, they appreciate the <strong>proximity</strong> and <strong>responsiveness of the support team</strong>, which is able to intervene quickly and effectively.</p>\n          <figure style=\"max-width:2048pxpx\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\">\n            <div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59b20419ffea_big-fernand-reception.webp\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>‍</p>\n        ",
